1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,867
Rule one. Count the exits. Not the
rooms. The exits.

2
00:00:03,367 --> 00:00:08,367
Rule two. Water before walls. You can
live in a broken house. You can't live
without water.

3
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:13,533
Rule four. Have a way out for someone
who can't run. I wrote that one. It's
for him.

4
00:00:14,033 --> 00:00:18,900
He means me. My inhaler has eleven
puffs in it. I wrote the number on my
sleeve.
